{"verse_key": "10:73", "surah": 10, "verse": 73, "text_uthmani": "فَكَذَّبُوهُ فَنَجَّيْنَـٰهُ وَمَن مَّعَهُۥ فِى ٱلْفُلْكِ وَجَعَلْنَـٰهُمْ خَلَـٰٓئِفَ وَأَغْرَقْنَا ٱلَّذِينَ كَذَّبُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا ۖ فَٱنظُرْ كَيْفَ كَانَ عَـٰقِبَةُ ٱلْمُنذَرِينَ", "translation": "And they denied him, so We saved him and those with him in the ship and made them successors, and We drowned those who denied Our signs. Then see how was the end of those who were warned.", "verse_from_ms": 1641470, "verse_to_ms": 1665420, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "فَكَذَّبُوهُ", "start_ms": 1641470, "end_ms": 1643230}, {"i": 1, "text": "فَنَجَّيْنَـٰهُ", "start_ms": 1643230, "end_ms": 1644840}, {"i": 2, "text": "وَمَن", "start_ms": 1644840, "end_ms": 1645380}, {"i": 3, "text": "مَّعَهُۥ", "start_ms": 1645380, "end_ms": 1646590}, {"i": 4, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 1646590, "end_ms": 1646870}, {"i": 5, "text": "ٱلْفُلْكِ", "start_ms": 1646870, "end_ms": 1647630}, {"i": 6, "text": "وَجَعَلْنَـٰهُمْ", "start_ms": 1647630, "end_ms": 1649150}, {"i": 7, "text": "خَلَـٰٓئِفَ", "start_ms": 1649150, "end_ms": 1651869}, {"i": 8, "text": "وَأَغْرَقْنَا", "start_ms": 1651870, "end_ms": 1653040}, {"i": 9, "text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 1653040, "end_ms": 1654010}, {"i": 10, "text": "كَذَّبُوا۟", "start_ms": 1654010, "end_ms": 1655080}, {"i": 11, "text": "بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا", "start_ms": 1655080, "end_ms": 1657430}, {"i": 12, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 1657430, "end_ms": 1659200}, {"i": 13, "text": "فَٱنظُرْ", "start_ms": 1659200, "end_ms": 1659810}, {"i": 14, "text": "كَيْفَ", "start_ms": 1659810, "end_ms": 1660380}, {"i": 15, "text": "كَانَ", "start_ms": 1660380, "end_ms": 1661420}, {"i": 16, "text": "عَـٰقِبَةُ", "start_ms": 1661420, "end_ms": 1664955}, {"i": 17, "text": "ٱلْمُنذَرِينَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}